<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39392" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιήρᾰνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pleasing, acceptable</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδέ τί μοι ποδάνιπτρα ποδῶν</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιήρανα θυμῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.343
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. after <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, <i>helping, assisting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μινύαις ἐπιήρανος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					98
				</span></i>
			 (prob.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>ruling, governing</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθηνάων</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιήρανε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1389
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				 ii1
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				2.683
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφῶν ἐ. ἔργων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					129.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλῶν ἐ. ἔργων</span>, of
			Dionysus, Ion Eleg.<i><span class="en">
				1.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. <i>warding
				off, re pelling</i>,
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιήρανος ἀσπὶς ἀκόντων̄</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.41
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Theon</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεύρων ἐπιή ρανος</span>
			<i>strengthening, giving tension</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				173.19
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
